window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b283-6544cd9fe612abc4.json"]={sha256:"6544cd9fe612abc44db581ed0b4e758ac01a63b5655d488ccab3bfb38e62f447",value:{"id":"b283","title":"沉箱式防波堤施工","titleEn":"Caisson breakwater construction","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"沿製造浮運到基床受力追蹤沉箱防波堤的狀態變化。課程從邊界辨識與資料整理走到水理量化、構造介面及驗證紀錄；每一步把計算結果連回可量測的證據。十個不同單元分別處理關鍵機制，不以名義尺寸或單一通過率代替整體工程判斷，並明列合成算例與現地資料的差別。","summaryEn":"Track caisson-breakwater state changes from fabrication and flotation to foundation loading. The course moves from boundary identification and evidence to hydraulic quantification, structural interfaces and verification records. Ten distinct units connect each calculated quantity to measurable evidence. Nominal geometry or a single pass rate does not establish whole-system performance, and synthetic teaching examples remain separate from field observations.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-coasts","subcategoryTitle":"海岸、港灣與水資源韌性","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coasts, ports and water-resource resilience","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-coasts","learningTags":["water","water-coasts","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-coast","architectureNodes":[["混凝土量與重量","Concrete volume and weight"],["初穩性幾何尺度","Initial stability geometry"],["配重與吃水增量","Ballast and draft increment"],["滑動平衡的界限","Limits of sliding equilibrium"],["雙側水壓與越流","Two-sided pressure and overflow"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-coast","labels":["混凝土量與重量","初穩性幾何尺度","配重與吃水增量","滑動平衡的界限","雙側水壓與越流"],"labelsEn":["Concrete volume and weight","Initial stability geometry","Ballast and draft increment","Limits of sliding equilibrium","Two-sided pressure and overflow"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"以下為原創合成算例，不是地標工程的實測或推薦操作值。教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設混凝土密度2400kg/m³、材料體積1000m³，質量2400000kg，重量mg=23544kN；這不是浮力所用外包體積。假設混凝土材料體積由1000增10%至1100m³、密度固定2400kg/m³，重量由23544增至25898.4kN；浮體的排水體積和重心必須另行更新，不能宣稱浮穩同步改善10%。重新計算前先列固定條件、單位、適用尺度及可能失效的邊界。把模型敏感度與測量誤差分開，不能將單一參數變化直接當成工程風險或壽命比例。比較兩次結果後，記錄還需要哪些獨立證據，並由負責專業人員判斷適用性。","textEn":"This original synthetic example is neither a landmark measurement nor a recommended operating value. Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume concrete density2400kg/m³ and material volume1000m³. Mass is2400000kg and weight23544kN; this is not the envelope volume used for buoyancy. Increasing concrete volume from1000 to1100m³ by10% at fixed2400kg/m³ changes weight from23544 to25898.4kN. Displacement and gravity center require separate updates; stability does not automatically improve by10%. Before recalculating, list fixed conditions, units, applicable scale and boundaries that could fail. Separate model sensitivity from measurement uncertainty: a parameter change does not directly give a proportional change in engineering risk or service life. Compare the results, record independent evidence still needed, and have the responsible specialist determine applicability.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b283-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「混凝土量與重量」與「靜態吃水平衡」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Concrete volume and weight\" and \"Static draft equilibrium\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b283-v15-01","title":"混凝土量與重量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Concrete volume and weight: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「混凝土量與重量」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Concrete volume and weight” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"沉箱的外包體積、混凝土材料體積與填艙材料量是不同量，浮運和落床分析不能交換使用。重量需要逐項配平，鋼筋、臨時設備和殘留水亦會改變重心；只看外部尺寸並不能得出可靠排水量。 假設混凝土密度2400kg/m³、材料體積1000m³，質量2400000kg，重量mg=23544kN；這不是浮力所用外包體積。 水下材料重量與浮運排水重量屬不同控制體，列式時必須保持同一受力邊界。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「混凝土量與重量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Envelope volume, concrete volume and ballast quantity are different quantities and cannot be exchanged between floating and seated conditions. Weight accounting also includes reinforcement, temporary equipment and retained water, all of which can shift the center of gravity despite unchanged outer dimensions. Assume concrete density2400kg/m³ and material volume1000m³. Mass is2400000kg and weight23544kN; this is not the envelope volume used for buoyancy. Submerged material weight and whole-body floating displacement use different control volumes, requiring a consistent force boundary when assembling equilibrium. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Concrete volume and weight” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「混凝土量與重量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Concrete volume and weight”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-01-k1","title":"混凝土量與重量","titleEn":"Concrete volume and weight","text":"沉箱的外包體積、混凝土材料體積與填艙材料量是不同量，浮運和落床分析不能交換使用。重量需要逐項配平，鋼筋、臨時設備和殘留水亦會改變重心；只看外部尺寸並不能得出可靠排水量。","textEn":"Envelope volume, concrete volume and ballast quantity are different quantities and cannot be exchanged between floating and seated conditions. Weight accounting also includes reinforcement, temporary equipment and retained water, all of which can shift the center of gravity despite unchanged outer dimensions.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「混凝土量與重量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Concrete volume and weight\" is correct?","options":["沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。","沉箱的外包體積、混凝土材料體積與填艙材料量是不同量，浮運和落床分析不能交換使用。","平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。"],"optionsEn":["Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass.","Envelope volume, concrete volume and ballast quantity are different quantities and cannot be exchanged between floating and seated conditions.","Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant."],"answer":1,"explanation":"沉箱的外包體積、混凝土材料體積與填艙材料量是不同量，浮運和落床分析不能交換使用。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Envelope volume, concrete volume and ballast quantity are different quantities and cannot be exchanged between floating and seated conditions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b283-v15-02","title":"混凝土量與重量：定量估算","titleEn":"Concrete volume and weight: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「混凝土量與重量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Concrete volume and weight” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設混凝土密度2400kg/m³、材料體積1000m³，質量2400000kg，重量mg=23544kN；這不是浮力所用外包體積。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume concrete density2400kg/m³ and material volume1000m³. Mass is2400000kg and weight23544kN; this is not the envelope volume used for buoyancy. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：依竣工尺寸與材料密度建立重量分項表，核對鋼筋、設備和艙水是否重複或遺漏。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build a weight schedule from actual geometry and densities, checking reinforcement, equipment and tank water for omission or duplication.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設混凝土密度2400kg/m³、材料體積1000m³，質量2400000kg，重量mg=23544kN；這不是浮力所用外包體積。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume concrete density2400kg/m³ and material volume1000m³. Mass is2400000kg and weight23544kN; this is not the envelope volume used for buoyancy.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「混凝土量與重量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Concrete volume and weight\", which statement holds?","options":["艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。","底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect.","Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b283-v15-03","title":"混凝土量與重量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Concrete volume and weight: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「混凝土量與重量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Concrete volume and weight” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"依竣工尺寸與材料密度建立重量分項表，核對鋼筋、設備和艙水是否重複或遺漏。用吃水及已知海水密度作獨立平衡檢查，追查差異而非調整密度湊合。將重量表各分項回連到量測證據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build a weight schedule from actual geometry and densities, checking reinforcement, equipment and tank water for omission or duplication. Independently compare draft and water density, investigating discrepancies rather than tuning density to fit. Link each weight-schedule entry to its measurement evidence. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：依竣工尺寸與材料密度建立重量分項表，核對鋼筋、設備和艙水是否重複或遺漏。用吃水及已知海水密度作獨立平衡檢查，追查差異而非調整密度湊合。","observationEn":"Site practice: Build a weight schedule from actual geometry and densities, checking reinforcement, equipment and tank water for omission or duplication. Independently compare draft and water density, investigating discrepancies rather than tuning density to fit.","failure":"注意干擾：將中空艙室也算成混凝土會高估重量，漏計艙水則低估吃水；兩項誤差可能偶然抵銷總重量卻留下錯誤重心，使後續浮穩判斷仍然失真。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Counting hollow cells as concrete overstates weight while omitting tank water understates draft. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依竣工尺寸與材料密度建立重量分項表，核對鋼筋、設備和艙水是否重複或遺漏。用吃水及已知海水密度作獨立平衡檢查，追查差異而非調整密度湊合。將重量表各分項回連到量測證據。","textEn":"Build a weight schedule from actual geometry and densities, checking reinforcement, equipment and tank water for omission or duplication. Independently compare draft and water density, investigating discrepancies rather than tuning density to fit. Link each weight-schedule entry to its measurement evidence.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"依竣工尺寸與材料密度建立重量分項表，核對鋼筋、設備和艙水是否重複或遺漏。用吃水及已知海水密度作獨立平衡檢查，追查差異而非調整密度湊合。","textEn":"Build a weight schedule from actual geometry and densities, checking reinforcement, equipment and tank water for omission or duplication. Independently compare draft and water density, investigating discrepancies rather than tuning density to fit.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「混凝土量與重量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Concrete volume and weight\"?","options":["依竣工尺寸與材料密度建立重量分項表，核對鋼筋、設備和艙水是否重複或遺漏。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。"],"optionsEn":["Build a weight schedule from actual geometry and densities, checking reinforcement, equipment and tank water for omission or duplication.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact."],"answer":0,"explanation":"依竣工尺寸與材料密度建立重量分項表，核對鋼筋、設備和艙水是否重複或遺漏。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build a weight schedule from actual geometry and densities, checking reinforcement, equipment and tank water for omission or duplication. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b283-v15-04","title":"混凝土量與重量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Concrete volume and weight: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「混凝土量與重量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Concrete volume and weight” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"將中空艙室也算成混凝土會高估重量，漏計艙水則低估吃水；兩項誤差可能偶然抵銷總重量卻留下錯誤重心，使後續浮穩判斷仍然失真。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Counting hollow cells as concrete overstates weight while omitting tank water understates draft. These errors may accidentally cancel total mass yet leave the center of gravity wrong, corrupting subsequent stability interpretation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：水下材料重量與浮運排水重量屬不同控制體，列式時必須保持同一受力邊界。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Submerged material weight and whole-body floating displacement use different control volumes, requiring a consistent force boundary when assembling equilibrium.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"將中空艙室也算成混凝土會高估重量，漏計艙水則低估吃水；兩項誤差可能偶然抵銷總重量卻留下錯誤重心，使後續浮穩判斷仍然失真。","textEn":"Counting hollow cells as concrete overstates weight while omitting tank water understates draft. These errors may accidentally cancel total mass yet leave the center of gravity wrong, corrupting subsequent stability interpretation.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「混凝土量與重量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Concrete volume and weight\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","將中空艙室也算成混凝土會高估重量，漏計艙水則低估吃水；兩項誤差可能偶然抵銷總重量卻留下錯誤重心，使後續浮穩判斷仍然失真。","平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Counting hollow cells as concrete overstates weight while omitting tank water understates draft.","Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant."],"answer":1,"explanation":"將中空艙室也算成混凝土會高估重量，漏計艙水則低估吃水；兩項誤差可能偶然抵銷總重量卻留下錯誤重心，使後續浮穩判斷仍然失真。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Counting hollow cells as concrete overstates weight while omitting tank water understates draft. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b283-v15-05","title":"靜態吃水平衡：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Static draft equilibrium: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「靜態吃水平衡」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Static draft equilibrium” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"完整密閉浮體在靜水中以排開水的重量平衡自重，矩形水線面才可用常面積直接換算吃水。艙口進水、外形變化和水面傾斜會改變條件，因此初步計算不能取代實際浮運狀態的檢查。 假設總質量2460000kg、海水1025kg/m³、水線面400m²，吃水T=m/(ρA)=6m；側高10m時靜態乾舷4m。 乾舷還須按可能先進水的開口高程判斷，外牆最高點不是唯一相關高度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「靜態吃水平衡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A sealed body at rest balances its weight with displaced water, and a constant rectangular waterplane permits direct draft conversion. Flooding, changing exterior geometry and heel alter the assumptions, so this initial calculation cannot replace verification of the actual floating condition. Assume mass2460000kg, seawater1025kg/m³ and waterplane400m². Draft T=m/(ρA)=6m; a10m side gives static freeboard4m. Freeboard also depends on openings that can admit water first; the highest exterior wall point is not the only relevant elevation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Static draft equilibrium” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「靜態吃水平衡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Static draft equilibrium”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-05-k1","title":"靜態吃水平衡","titleEn":"Static draft equilibrium","text":"完整密閉浮體在靜水中以排開水的重量平衡自重，矩形水線面才可用常面積直接換算吃水。艙口進水、外形變化和水面傾斜會改變條件，因此初步計算不能取代實際浮運狀態的檢查。","textEn":"A sealed body at rest balances its weight with displaced water, and a constant rectangular waterplane permits direct draft conversion. Flooding, changing exterior geometry and heel alter the assumptions, so this initial calculation cannot replace verification of the actual floating condition.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「靜態吃水平衡」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Static draft equilibrium\" is correct?","options":["平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。","初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。","完整密閉浮體在靜水中以排開水的重量平衡自重，矩形水線面才可用常面積直接換算吃水。"],"optionsEn":["Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant.","Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition.","A sealed body at rest balances its weight with displaced water, and a constant rectangular waterplane permits direct draft conversion."],"answer":2,"explanation":"完整密閉浮體在靜水中以排開水的重量平衡自重，矩形水線面才可用常面積直接換算吃水。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A sealed body at rest balances its weight with displaced water, and a constant rectangular waterplane permits direct draft conversion. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b283-v15-06","title":"靜態吃水平衡：定量估算","titleEn":"Static draft equilibrium: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「靜態吃水平衡」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Static draft equilibrium” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設總質量2460000kg、海水1025kg/m³、水線面400m²，吃水T=m/(ρA)=6m；側高10m時靜態乾舷4m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume mass2460000kg, seawater1025kg/m³ and waterplane400m². Draft T=m/(ρA)=6m; a10m side gives static freeboard4m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在多個角點讀取吃水，換算共同水位並檢查傾斜，將實測排水量和重量表核對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Read draft at several corners, reference a common level and check heel against the weight schedule.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設總質量2460000kg、海水1025kg/m³、水線面400m²，吃水T=m/(ρA)=6m；側高10m時靜態乾舷4m。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume mass2460000kg, seawater1025kg/m³ and waterplane400m². Draft T=m/(ρA)=6m; a10m side gives static freeboard4m.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「靜態吃水平衡」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Static draft equilibrium\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。","沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence.","A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b283-v15-07","title":"靜態吃水平衡：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Static draft equilibrium: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「靜態吃水平衡」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Static draft equilibrium” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在多個角點讀取吃水，換算共同水位並檢查傾斜，將實測排水量和重量表核對。另列波浪、拖航和艙口條件，避免把靜水乾舷當成任何海況的操作裕度。另記最低非密閉開口的高程。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Read draft at several corners, reference a common level and check heel against the weight schedule. Separately document waves, towing and openings rather than treating calm-water freeboard as a margin for every sea state. Record the lowest unsealed opening elevation independently. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在多個角點讀取吃水，換算共同水位並檢查傾斜，將實測排水量和重量表核對。另列波浪、拖航和艙口條件，避免把靜水乾舷當成任何海況的操作裕度。","observationEn":"Site practice: Read draft at several corners, reference a common level and check heel against the weight schedule. Separately document waves, towing and openings rather than treating calm-water freeboard as a margin for every sea state.","failure":"注意干擾：艙內漏水會使吃水增加並可能降低乾舷，僅讀取一側吃水又會漏掉傾斜。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Internal flooding increases draft and may reduce freeboard, while one-sided readings miss heel. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在多個角點讀取吃水，換算共同水位並檢查傾斜，將實測排水量和重量表核對。另列波浪、拖航和艙口條件，避免把靜水乾舷當成任何海況的操作裕度。另記最低非密閉開口的高程。","textEn":"Read draft at several corners, reference a common level and check heel against the weight schedule. Separately document waves, towing and openings rather than treating calm-water freeboard as a margin for every sea state. Record the lowest unsealed opening elevation independently.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在多個角點讀取吃水，換算共同水位並檢查傾斜，將實測排水量和重量表核對。另列波浪、拖航和艙口條件，避免把靜水乾舷當成任何海況的操作裕度。","textEn":"Read draft at several corners, reference a common level and check heel against the weight schedule. Separately document waves, towing and openings rather than treating calm-water freeboard as a margin for every sea state.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「靜態吃水平衡」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Static draft equilibrium\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","在多個角點讀取吃水，換算共同水位並檢查傾斜，將實測排水量和重量表核對。","兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Read draft at several corners, reference a common level and check heel against the weight schedule.","Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在多個角點讀取吃水，換算共同水位並檢查傾斜，將實測排水量和重量表核對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Read draft at several corners, reference a common level and check heel against the weight schedule. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b283-v15-08","title":"靜態吃水平衡：失效診斷","titleEn":"Static draft equilibrium: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「靜態吃水平衡」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Static draft equilibrium” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"艙內漏水會使吃水增加並可能降低乾舷，僅讀取一側吃水又會漏掉傾斜。靜態平均值看似符合計算時，另一角仍可能先進水並改變整個浮力邊界。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Internal flooding increases draft and may reduce freeboard, while one-sided readings miss heel. Even a matching mean draft can conceal an exposed corner that floods first and changes the complete buoyancy boundary. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：乾舷還須按可能先進水的開口高程判斷，外牆最高點不是唯一相關高度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Freeboard also depends on openings that can admit water first; the highest exterior wall point is not the only relevant elevation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"艙內漏水會使吃水增加並可能降低乾舷，僅讀取一側吃水又會漏掉傾斜。靜態平均值看似符合計算時，另一角仍可能先進水並改變整個浮力邊界。","textEn":"Internal flooding increases draft and may reduce freeboard, while one-sided readings miss heel. Even a matching mean draft can conceal an exposed corner that floods first and changes the complete buoyancy boundary.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「靜態吃水平衡」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Static draft equilibrium\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。","艙內漏水會使吃水增加並可能降低乾舷，僅讀取一側吃水又會漏掉傾斜。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition.","Internal flooding increases draft and may reduce freeboard, while one-sided readings miss heel."],"answer":2,"explanation":"艙內漏水會使吃水增加並可能降低乾舷，僅讀取一側吃水又會漏掉傾斜。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Internal flooding increases draft and may reduce freeboard, while one-sided readings miss heel. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b283-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「初穩性幾何尺度」與「艙內自由液面」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Initial stability geometry\" and \"Internal free-surface effect\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b283-v15-09","title":"初穩性幾何尺度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Initial stability geometry: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「初穩性幾何尺度」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Initial stability geometry” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"小角度浮穩分析以浮心、重心和水線面慣性矩建立初穩心高度，與大角度復原力臂並不相同。水線形狀和轉動軸必須明示，不能用一個正值保證拖航中所有波浪、風力及進水情境都穩定。 假設20m×20m矩形水線、吃水6m、排水V=2400m³、KB=3m、KG=7m，GM=3+(20×20³/12)/2400−7=1.556m。 初穩性公式的排水體積必須對應當下吃水，改變配重後不能只更新重心。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「初穩性幾何尺度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Small-angle stability uses buoyancy center, gravity center and waterplane second moment to obtain metacentric height, not the full large-angle righting arm. Define the waterplane and rotation axis explicitly; a positive value cannot qualify every towing, wind, wave or flooding case. Assume20m×20m waterplane,6m draft, displacement2400m³, KB=3m and KG=7m. GM=3+(20×20³/12)/2400−7=1.556m. The displacement volume in initial stability must match current draft; after ballasting, updating gravity center alone is not sufficient. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Initial stability geometry” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「初穩性幾何尺度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Initial stability geometry”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-09-k1","title":"初穩性幾何尺度","titleEn":"Initial stability geometry","text":"小角度浮穩分析以浮心、重心和水線面慣性矩建立初穩心高度，與大角度復原力臂並不相同。水線形狀和轉動軸必須明示，不能用一個正值保證拖航中所有波浪、風力及進水情境都穩定。","textEn":"Small-angle stability uses buoyancy center, gravity center and waterplane second moment to obtain metacentric height, not the full large-angle righting arm. Define the waterplane and rotation axis explicitly; a positive value cannot qualify every towing, wind, wave or flooding case.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「初穩性幾何尺度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Initial stability geometry\" is correct?","options":["小角度浮穩分析以浮心、重心和水線面慣性矩建立初穩心高度，與大角度復原力臂並不相同。","初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。","艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["Small-angle stability uses buoyancy center, gravity center and waterplane second moment to obtain metacentric height, not the full large-angle righting arm.","Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition.","An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect."],"answer":0,"explanation":"小角度浮穩分析以浮心、重心和水線面慣性矩建立初穩心高度，與大角度復原力臂並不相同。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Small-angle stability uses buoyancy center, gravity center and waterplane second moment to obtain metacentric height, not the full large-angle righting arm. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b283-v15-10","title":"初穩性幾何尺度：定量估算","titleEn":"Initial stability geometry: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「初穩性幾何尺度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Initial stability geometry” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設20m×20m矩形水線、吃水6m、排水V=2400m³、KB=3m、KG=7m，GM=3+(20×20³/12)/2400−7=1.556m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume20m×20m waterplane,6m draft, displacement2400m³, KB=3m and KG=7m. GM=3+(20×20³/12)/2400−7=1.556m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在圖上標出轉動軸和慣性矩計算方向，逐項核對重心與浮心的高程基準。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw the rotation axis and second-moment direction and verify common datums for gravity and buoyancy centers.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設20m×20m矩形水線、吃水6m、排水V=2400m³、KB=3m、KG=7m，GM=3+(20×20³/12)/2400−7=1.556m。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume20m×20m waterplane,6m draft, displacement2400m³, KB=3m and KG=7m. GM=3+(20×20³/12)/2400−7=1.556m.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「初穩性幾何尺度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Initial stability geometry\", which statement holds?","options":["底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。"],"optionsEn":["Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b283-v15-11","title":"初穩性幾何尺度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Initial stability geometry: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「初穩性幾何尺度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Initial stability geometry” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在圖上標出轉動軸和慣性矩計算方向，逐項核對重心與浮心的高程基準。再檢查艙內自由液面及可能進水位置，把小角線性結果與完整浮穩需求分開。再以排水質量驗算當下浮力平衡。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw the rotation axis and second-moment direction and verify common datums for gravity and buoyancy centers. Check internal free surfaces and flooding openings separately, distinguishing the small-angle result from complete stability requirements. Recheck current buoyancy against the displacement mass. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在圖上標出轉動軸和慣性矩計算方向，逐項核對重心與浮心的高程基準。再檢查艙內自由液面及可能進水位置，把小角線性結果與完整浮穩需求分開。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw the rotation axis and second-moment direction and verify common datums for gravity and buoyancy centers. Check internal free surfaces and flooding openings separately, distinguishing the small-angle result from complete stability requirements.","failure":"注意干擾：軸向用錯會把長寬差異轉成巨大剛度誤差，重心漏算又會高估復原能力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using the wrong axis transforms length-width differences into a major stiffness error, while omitted weights overstate righting ability. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在圖上標出轉動軸和慣性矩計算方向，逐項核對重心與浮心的高程基準。再檢查艙內自由液面及可能進水位置，把小角線性結果與完整浮穩需求分開。再以排水質量驗算當下浮力平衡。","textEn":"Draw the rotation axis and second-moment direction and verify common datums for gravity and buoyancy centers. Check internal free surfaces and flooding openings separately, distinguishing the small-angle result from complete stability requirements. Recheck current buoyancy against the displacement mass.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在圖上標出轉動軸和慣性矩計算方向，逐項核對重心與浮心的高程基準。再檢查艙內自由液面及可能進水位置，把小角線性結果與完整浮穩需求分開。","textEn":"Draw the rotation axis and second-moment direction and verify common datums for gravity and buoyancy centers. Check internal free surfaces and flooding openings separately, distinguishing the small-angle result from complete stability requirements.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「初穩性幾何尺度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Initial stability geometry\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。","在圖上標出轉動軸和慣性矩計算方向，逐項核對重心與浮心的高程基準。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow.","Draw the rotation axis and second-moment direction and verify common datums for gravity and buoyancy centers."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在圖上標出轉動軸和慣性矩計算方向，逐項核對重心與浮心的高程基準。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw the rotation axis and second-moment direction and verify common datums for gravity and buoyancy centers. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b283-v15-12","title":"初穩性幾何尺度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Initial stability geometry: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「初穩性幾何尺度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Initial stability geometry” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"軸向用錯會把長寬差異轉成巨大剛度誤差，重心漏算又會高估復原能力。正初穩心高度不能排除大角度失穩，也不能抵銷自由液面與波浪耦合的不利影響。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using the wrong axis transforms length-width differences into a major stiffness error, while omitted weights overstate righting ability. Positive initial height does not exclude large-angle instability or adverse free-surface and wave coupling. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：初穩性公式的排水體積必須對應當下吃水，改變配重後不能只更新重心。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The displacement volume in initial stability must match current draft; after ballasting, updating gravity center alone is not sufficient.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"軸向用錯會把長寬差異轉成巨大剛度誤差，重心漏算又會高估復原能力。正初穩心高度不能排除大角度失穩，也不能抵銷自由液面與波浪耦合的不利影響。","textEn":"Using the wrong axis transforms length-width differences into a major stiffness error, while omitted weights overstate righting ability. Positive initial height does not exclude large-angle instability or adverse free-surface and wave coupling.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「初穩性幾何尺度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Initial stability geometry\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["軸向用錯會把長寬差異轉成巨大剛度誤差，重心漏算又會高估復原能力。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["Using the wrong axis transforms length-width differences into a major stiffness error, while omitted weights overstate righting ability.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect."],"answer":0,"explanation":"軸向用錯會把長寬差異轉成巨大剛度誤差，重心漏算又會高估復原能力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using the wrong axis transforms length-width differences into a major stiffness error, while omitted weights overstate righting ability. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b283-v15-13","title":"艙內自由液面：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Internal free-surface effect: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「艙內自由液面」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Internal free-surface effect” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"部分裝滿的艙液會隨浮體傾斜移動，等效降低初穩性；全空或全滿的情況不能套同一自由液面修正。液面慣性矩與連通範圍比液體總量更重要，因此分艙完整性是浮穩模型的一部分。 假設同密度艙水的自由液面10m×10m、排水2400m³，修正ΔGM=If/V=(10×10³/12)/2400=0.3472m；只適用小角近似。 修正也取決於艙液與外水的密度比，不同液體時不能直接省略該係數。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「艙內自由液面」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Liquid in a partially filled tank shifts with heel and reduces initial stability. Empty and pressed-full tanks do not share this correction. Surface second moment and connected extent matter more than liquid quantity alone, making compartment integrity part of the stability model. Assume same-density tank water, a10m×10m free surface and2400m³ displacement. ΔGM=If/V=0.3472m under the small-angle approximation. The correction also depends on the density ratio between tank liquid and surrounding water, which cannot be omitted for different liquids. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Internal free-surface effect” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「艙內自由液面」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Internal free-surface effect”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-13-k1","title":"艙內自由液面","titleEn":"Internal free-surface effect","text":"部分裝滿的艙液會隨浮體傾斜移動，等效降低初穩性；全空或全滿的情況不能套同一自由液面修正。液面慣性矩與連通範圍比液體總量更重要，因此分艙完整性是浮穩模型的一部分。","textEn":"Liquid in a partially filled tank shifts with heel and reduces initial stability. Empty and pressed-full tanks do not share this correction.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「艙內自由液面」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Internal free-surface effect\" is correct?","options":["艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。","部分裝滿的艙液會隨浮體傾斜移動，等效降低初穩性；全空或全滿的情況不能套同一自由液面修正。","計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。"],"optionsEn":["An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect.","Liquid in a partially filled tank shifts with heel and reduces initial stability.","A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"部分裝滿的艙液會隨浮體傾斜移動，等效降低初穩性；全空或全滿的情況不能套同一自由液面修正。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Liquid in a partially filled tank shifts with heel and reduces initial stability. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b283-v15-14","title":"艙內自由液面：定量估算","titleEn":"Internal free-surface effect: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「艙內自由液面」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Internal free-surface effect” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設同密度艙水的自由液面10m×10m、排水2400m³，修正ΔGM=If/V=(10×10³/12)/2400=0.3472m；只適用小角近似。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume same-density tank water, a10m×10m free surface and2400m³ displacement. ΔGM=If/V=0.3472m under the small-angle approximation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：逐艙畫出液位與可能連通路徑，核對修正所用液體密度和自由面尺寸。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Map levels and possible connections in each cell, verifying fluid density and surface dimensions in the correction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設同密度艙水的自由液面10m×10m、排水2400m³，修正ΔGM=If/V=(10×10³/12)/2400=0.3472m；只適用小角近似。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume same-density tank water, a10m×10m free surface and2400m³ displacement. ΔGM=If/V=0.3472m under the small-angle approximation.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「艙內自由液面」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Internal free-surface effect\", which statement holds?","options":["沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。","兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance.","Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b283-v15-15","title":"艙內自由液面：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Internal free-surface effect: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「艙內自由液面」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Internal free-surface effect” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"逐艙畫出液位與可能連通路徑，核對修正所用液體密度和自由面尺寸。比較隔艙完整與連通的模型，並保存任何配置變更的浮穩再評估紀錄。明列艙水與外水的密度比。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Map levels and possible connections in each cell, verifying fluid density and surface dimensions in the correction. Compare isolated and connected compartments and retain the stability reassessment for every configuration change. State the tank-liquid to surrounding-water density ratio explicitly. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：逐艙畫出液位與可能連通路徑，核對修正所用液體密度和自由面尺寸。比較隔艙完整與連通的模型，並保存任何配置變更的浮穩再評估紀錄。","observationEn":"Site practice: Map levels and possible connections in each cell, verifying fluid density and surface dimensions in the correction. Compare isolated and connected compartments and retain the stability reassessment for every configuration change.","failure":"注意干擾：隔板開孔造成原先獨立液面連通時，慣性矩可大幅增加；只看總艙水量不變會漏掉穩性下降。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Openings that connect previously separate tanks can greatly increase surface second moment. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐艙畫出液位與可能連通路徑，核對修正所用液體密度和自由面尺寸。比較隔艙完整與連通的模型，並保存任何配置變更的浮穩再評估紀錄。明列艙水與外水的密度比。","textEn":"Map levels and possible connections in each cell, verifying fluid density and surface dimensions in the correction. Compare isolated and connected compartments and retain the stability reassessment for every configuration change. State the tank-liquid to surrounding-water density ratio explicitly.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"逐艙畫出液位與可能連通路徑，核對修正所用液體密度和自由面尺寸。比較隔艙完整與連通的模型，並保存任何配置變更的浮穩再評估紀錄。","textEn":"Map levels and possible connections in each cell, verifying fluid density and surface dimensions in the correction. Compare isolated and connected compartments and retain the stability reassessment for every configuration change.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「艙內自由液面」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Internal free-surface effect\"?","options":["逐艙畫出液位與可能連通路徑，核對修正所用液體密度和自由面尺寸。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。"],"optionsEn":["Map levels and possible connections in each cell, verifying fluid density and surface dimensions in the correction.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass."],"answer":0,"explanation":"逐艙畫出液位與可能連通路徑，核對修正所用液體密度和自由面尺寸。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Map levels and possible connections in each cell, verifying fluid density and surface dimensions in the correction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b283-v15-16","title":"艙內自由液面：失效診斷","titleEn":"Internal free-surface effect: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「艙內自由液面」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Internal free-surface effect” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"隔板開孔造成原先獨立液面連通時，慣性矩可大幅增加；只看總艙水量不變會漏掉穩性下降。液位誤判為全滿也可能完全省略實際存在的自由液面。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Openings that connect previously separate tanks can greatly increase surface second moment. Unchanged total water volume conceals lost stability, and incorrectly declaring a tank full can omit an existing free surface entirely. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：修正也取決於艙液與外水的密度比，不同液體時不能直接省略該係數。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The correction also depends on the density ratio between tank liquid and surrounding water, which cannot be omitted for different liquids.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"隔板開孔造成原先獨立液面連通時，慣性矩可大幅增加；只看總艙水量不變會漏掉穩性下降。液位誤判為全滿也可能完全省略實際存在的自由液面。","textEn":"Openings that connect previously separate tanks can greatly increase surface second moment. Unchanged total water volume conceals lost stability, and incorrectly declaring a tank full can omit an existing free surface entirely.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「艙內自由液面」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Internal free-surface effect\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","隔板開孔造成原先獨立液面連通時，慣性矩可大幅增加；只看總艙水量不變會漏掉穩性下降。","計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Openings that connect previously separate tanks can greatly increase surface second moment.","A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"隔板開孔造成原先獨立液面連通時，慣性矩可大幅增加；只看總艙水量不變會漏掉穩性下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Openings that connect previously separate tanks can greatly increase surface second moment. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b283-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「配重與吃水增量」與「底面揚壓積分」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Ballast and draft increment\" and \"Base-uplift integration\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b283-v15-17","title":"配重與吃水增量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Ballast and draft increment: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「配重與吃水增量」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Ballast and draft increment” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"增加配重會增加排水量，但各艙位置也決定傾斜和結構內力。常水線面換算只能估平均吃水增量，不能推定所有角點同步下沉，也不能以這個靜力算式指揮實際沉放程序。 假設增重205000kg、海水1025kg/m³、水線面400m²，ΔT=Δm/(ρA)=0.50m；水線面與密閉狀態保持不變。 吃水增量與波浪造成的瞬時角點運動不同，量測比較應採對應的時間平均。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「配重與吃水增量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Added ballast increases displacement while its location changes heel and internal actions. A constant-waterplane conversion estimates mean draft increment only; it does not imply equal movement at every corner or authorize an actual lowering sequence from this static calculation. Assume added205000kg, seawater1025kg/m³ and waterplane400m². ΔT=Δm/(ρA)=0.50m at unchanged geometry and sealed condition. Draft increment differs from instantaneous corner motion caused by waves, so measurement comparisons require a matching averaging period and definition. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Ballast and draft increment” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「配重與吃水增量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Ballast and draft increment”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-17-k1","title":"配重與吃水增量","titleEn":"Ballast and draft increment","text":"增加配重會增加排水量，但各艙位置也決定傾斜和結構內力。常水線面換算只能估平均吃水增量，不能推定所有角點同步下沉，也不能以這個靜力算式指揮實際沉放程序。","textEn":"Added ballast increases displacement while its location changes heel and internal actions. A constant-waterplane conversion estimates mean draft increment only; it does not imply equal movement at every corner or authorize an actual lowering sequence from this static calculation.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「配重與吃水增量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Ballast and draft increment\" is correct?","options":["計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。","底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。","增加配重會增加排水量，但各艙位置也決定傾斜和結構內力。"],"optionsEn":["A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence.","Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.","Added ballast increases displacement while its location changes heel and internal actions."],"answer":2,"explanation":"增加配重會增加排水量，但各艙位置也決定傾斜和結構內力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Added ballast increases displacement while its location changes heel and internal actions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b283-v15-18","title":"配重與吃水增量：定量估算","titleEn":"Ballast and draft increment: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「配重與吃水增量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Ballast and draft increment” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設增重205000kg、海水1025kg/m³、水線面400m²，ΔT=Δm/(ρA)=0.50m；水線面與密閉狀態保持不變。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume added205000kg, seawater1025kg/m³ and waterplane400m². ΔT=Δm/(ρA)=0.50m at unchanged geometry and sealed condition. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將配重位置和總重量分開列示，核對四角吃水增量及艙內實際液位。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record ballast positions separately from total weight and compare corner draft changes with actual cell levels.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設增重205000kg、海水1025kg/m³、水線面400m²，ΔT=Δm/(ρA)=0.50m；水線面與密閉狀態保持不變。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume added205000kg, seawater1025kg/m³ and waterplane400m². ΔT=Δm/(ρA)=0.50m at unchanged geometry and sealed condition.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「配重與吃水增量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Ballast and draft increment\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。","已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact.","Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b283-v15-19","title":"配重與吃水增量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Ballast and draft increment: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「配重與吃水增量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Ballast and draft increment” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將配重位置和總重量分開列示，核對四角吃水增量及艙內實際液位。以受核准的施工控制紀錄比較預測與量測，不用平均吃水掩蓋局部傾斜或設備故障。檢查吃水量測的時間平均窗口。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record ballast positions separately from total weight and compare corner draft changes with actual cell levels. Use the approved construction-control record to investigate disagreement without hiding heel or equipment faults behind mean draft. Check the averaging window used for draft observations. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將配重位置和總重量分開列示，核對四角吃水增量及艙內實際液位。以受核准的施工控制紀錄比較預測與量測，不用平均吃水掩蓋局部傾斜或設備故障。","observationEn":"Site practice: Record ballast positions separately from total weight and compare corner draft changes with actual cell levels. Use the approved construction-control record to investigate disagreement without hiding heel or equipment faults behind mean draft.","failure":"注意干擾：一側閥件或量測失效可能使平均增重正確但傾斜快速擴大，艙內自由液面也可能同時改變；若只依總重量完成指標，便會漏掉真正控制過渡狀態的介面。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A one-sided valve or measurement fault can produce the correct total added mass while heel grows. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將配重位置和總重量分開列示，核對四角吃水增量及艙內實際液位。以受核准的施工控制紀錄比較預測與量測，不用平均吃水掩蓋局部傾斜或設備故障。檢查吃水量測的時間平均窗口。","textEn":"Record ballast positions separately from total weight and compare corner draft changes with actual cell levels. Use the approved construction-control record to investigate disagreement without hiding heel or equipment faults behind mean draft. Check the averaging window used for draft observations.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將配重位置和總重量分開列示，核對四角吃水增量及艙內實際液位。以受核准的施工控制紀錄比較預測與量測，不用平均吃水掩蓋局部傾斜或設備故障。","textEn":"Record ballast positions separately from total weight and compare corner draft changes with actual cell levels. Use the approved construction-control record to investigate disagreement without hiding heel or equipment faults behind mean draft.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「配重與吃水增量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Ballast and draft increment\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","將配重位置和總重量分開列示，核對四角吃水增量及艙內實際液位。","平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Record ballast positions separately from total weight and compare corner draft changes with actual cell levels.","Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant."],"answer":1,"explanation":"將配重位置和總重量分開列示，核對四角吃水增量及艙內實際液位。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record ballast positions separately from total weight and compare corner draft changes with actual cell levels. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b283-v15-20","title":"配重與吃水增量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Ballast and draft increment: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「配重與吃水增量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Ballast and draft increment” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"一側閥件或量測失效可能使平均增重正確但傾斜快速擴大，艙內自由液面也可能同時改變；若只依總重量完成指標，便會漏掉真正控制過渡狀態的介面。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A one-sided valve or measurement fault can produce the correct total added mass while heel grows. Free-surface effects may change simultaneously, so total-weight completion alone misses the interface governing the transition. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：吃水增量與波浪造成的瞬時角點運動不同，量測比較應採對應的時間平均。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Draft increment differs from instantaneous corner motion caused by waves, so measurement comparisons require a matching averaging period and definition.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"一側閥件或量測失效可能使平均增重正確但傾斜快速擴大，艙內自由液面也可能同時改變；若只依總重量完成指標，便會漏掉真正控制過渡狀態的介面。","textEn":"A one-sided valve or measurement fault can produce the correct total added mass while heel grows. Free-surface effects may change simultaneously, so total-weight completion alone misses the interface governing the transition.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「配重與吃水增量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Ballast and draft increment\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。","一側閥件或量測失效可能使平均增重正確但傾斜快速擴大，艙內自由液面也可能同時改變；若只依總重量完成指標，便會漏掉真正控制過渡狀態的介面。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.","A one-sided valve or measurement fault can produce the correct total added mass while heel grows."],"answer":2,"explanation":"一側閥件或量測失效可能使平均增重正確但傾斜快速擴大，艙內自由液面也可能同時改變；若只依總重量完成指標，便會漏掉真正控制過渡狀態的介面。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A one-sided valve or measurement fault can produce the correct total added mass while heel grows. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b283-v15-21","title":"底面揚壓積分：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Base-uplift integration: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「底面揚壓積分」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Base-uplift integration” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"落床沉箱底面水壓減少有效壓力接觸，分布取決於滲流、排水與波浪傳遞。兩端線性插值是一個假設，不是所有基床都會呈現的真實形狀；合力與作用點都會影響滑動和偏心。 假設每米堤長、底寬20m，底壓由80線性降至20kPa，U=(80+20)×20/2=1000kN/m；未計時變壓力。 底壓作用點還決定傾覆力矩，相同揚壓總量不代表相同底面接觸狀態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「底面揚壓積分」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pressure beneath a seated caisson reduces effective contact and depends on seepage, drainage and wave transmission. Linear interpolation between edges is an assumption rather than a universal foundation pattern. Both resultant and location influence sliding and eccentric response. Assume unit breakwater length,20m base width and linear pressure from80 to20kPa. U=(80+20)×20/2=1000kN/m, excluding time variation. The uplift application point also determines moment, so equal total uplift does not imply an identical foundation contact-pressure distribution. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Base-uplift integration” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「底面揚壓積分」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Base-uplift integration”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-21-k1","title":"底面揚壓積分","titleEn":"Base-uplift integration","text":"落床沉箱底面水壓減少有效壓力接觸，分布取決於滲流、排水與波浪傳遞。兩端線性插值是一個假設，不是所有基床都會呈現的真實形狀；合力與作用點都會影響滑動和偏心。","textEn":"Pressure beneath a seated caisson reduces effective contact and depends on seepage, drainage and wave transmission. Linear interpolation between edges is an assumption rather than a universal foundation pattern.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「底面揚壓積分」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Base-uplift integration\" is correct?","options":["落床沉箱底面水壓減少有效壓力接觸，分布取決於滲流、排水與波浪傳遞。","底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。","沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。"],"optionsEn":["Pressure beneath a seated caisson reduces effective contact and depends on seepage, drainage and wave transmission.","Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.","A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"落床沉箱底面水壓減少有效壓力接觸，分布取決於滲流、排水與波浪傳遞。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pressure beneath a seated caisson reduces effective contact and depends on seepage, drainage and wave transmission. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b283-v15-22","title":"底面揚壓積分：定量估算","titleEn":"Base-uplift integration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「底面揚壓積分」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Base-uplift integration” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米堤長、底寬20m，底壓由80線性降至20kPa，U=(80+20)×20/2=1000kN/m；未計時變壓力。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume unit breakwater length,20m base width and linear pressure from80 to20kPa. U=(80+20)×20/2=1000kN/m, excluding time variation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用同一時間的底面壓力重建分布，檢查端點之間是否有測點支持線性假設。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Reconstruct the distribution from simultaneous base pressures and check intermediate evidence for linearity.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米堤長、底寬20m，底壓由80線性降至20kPa，U=(80+20)×20/2=1000kN/m；未計時變壓力。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume unit breakwater length,20m base width and linear pressure from80 to20kPa. U=(80+20)×20/2=1000kN/m, excluding time variation.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「底面揚壓積分」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Base-uplift integration\", which statement holds?","options":["兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。"],"optionsEn":["Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b283-v15-23","title":"底面揚壓積分：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Base-uplift integration: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「底面揚壓積分」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Base-uplift integration” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用同一時間的底面壓力重建分布，檢查端點之間是否有測點支持線性假設。將揚壓積分和接觸反力核對，另列波峰與波谷可能不同的傳壓相位。另外積分壓力對底面中心的力矩。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Reconstruct the distribution from simultaneous base pressures and check intermediate evidence for linearity. Compare integrated uplift with contact reaction, documenting different transmission phases at wave crests and troughs rather than mixing them. Integrate the pressure moment about the base center separately. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用同一時間的底面壓力重建分布，檢查端點之間是否有測點支持線性假設。將揚壓積分和接觸反力核對，另列波峰與波谷可能不同的傳壓相位。","observationEn":"Site practice: Reconstruct the distribution from simultaneous base pressures and check intermediate evidence for linearity. Compare integrated uplift with contact reaction, documenting different transmission phases at wave crests and troughs rather than mixing them.","failure":"注意干擾：底面中部高壓可能被端點量測漏掉，排水堵塞也會改變分布。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An internal pressure high can escape edge measurements, and blocked drainage changes the distribution. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用同一時間的底面壓力重建分布，檢查端點之間是否有測點支持線性假設。將揚壓積分和接觸反力核對，另列波峰與波谷可能不同的傳壓相位。另外積分壓力對底面中心的力矩。","textEn":"Reconstruct the distribution from simultaneous base pressures and check intermediate evidence for linearity. Compare integrated uplift with contact reaction, documenting different transmission phases at wave crests and troughs rather than mixing them. Integrate the pressure moment about the base center separately.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用同一時間的底面壓力重建分布，檢查端點之間是否有測點支持線性假設。將揚壓積分和接觸反力核對，另列波峰與波谷可能不同的傳壓相位。","textEn":"Reconstruct the distribution from simultaneous base pressures and check intermediate evidence for linearity. Compare integrated uplift with contact reaction, documenting different transmission phases at wave crests and troughs rather than mixing them.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「底面揚壓積分」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Base-uplift integration\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。","用同一時間的底面壓力重建分布，檢查端點之間是否有測點支持線性假設。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition.","Reconstruct the distribution from simultaneous base pressures and check intermediate evidence for linearity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用同一時間的底面壓力重建分布，檢查端點之間是否有測點支持線性假設。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Reconstruct the distribution from simultaneous base pressures and check intermediate evidence for linearity. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b283-v15-24","title":"底面揚壓積分：失效診斷","titleEn":"Base-uplift integration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「底面揚壓積分」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Base-uplift integration” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"底面中部高壓可能被端點量測漏掉，排水堵塞也會改變分布。把不同時刻的壓力峰值任意拼在一起，則可能製造不存在的合力與偏心，兩種錯誤方向都需查核。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An internal pressure high can escape edge measurements, and blocked drainage changes the distribution. Combining unrelated peak times can instead create a nonexistent force and eccentricity; both error directions require investigation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：底壓作用點還決定傾覆力矩，相同揚壓總量不代表相同底面接觸狀態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The uplift application point also determines moment, so equal total uplift does not imply an identical foundation contact-pressure distribution.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"底面中部高壓可能被端點量測漏掉，排水堵塞也會改變分布。把不同時刻的壓力峰值任意拼在一起，則可能製造不存在的合力與偏心，兩種錯誤方向都需查核。","textEn":"An internal pressure high can escape edge measurements, and blocked drainage changes the distribution. Combining unrelated peak times can instead create a nonexistent force and eccentricity; both error directions require investigation.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「底面揚壓積分」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Base-uplift integration\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["底面中部高壓可能被端點量測漏掉，排水堵塞也會改變分布。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。"],"optionsEn":["An internal pressure high can escape edge measurements, and blocked drainage changes the distribution.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"底面中部高壓可能被端點量測漏掉，排水堵塞也會改變分布。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An internal pressure high can escape edge measurements, and blocked drainage changes the distribution. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b283-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「滑動平衡的界限」與「偏心與全接觸」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Limits of sliding equilibrium\" and \"Eccentricity and full contact\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b283-v15-25","title":"滑動平衡的界限：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Limits of sliding equilibrium: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「滑動平衡的界限」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Limits of sliding equilibrium” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"簡化摩擦抵抗以有效法向力為基礎，底面揚壓不能忽略。摩擦係數受材料和接觸狀態影響，動態荷載、搖擺與地基破壞則另有機制；一個比值不能涵蓋所有施工與使用狀態。 假設每米W=4000kN、U=1000kN、μ=0.6、H=1500kN，R=μ(W−U)=1800kN，R/H=1.20；非規範安全係數。 水平與垂直動載若不同相位，摩擦餘裕的最小時刻不一定是最大水平力時刻。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「滑動平衡的界限」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A friction estimate depends on effective normal force, including uplift reduction. Interface material and condition govern the coefficient, while dynamic loading, rocking and foundation failure involve additional mechanisms. One equilibrium ratio does not cover every construction and operational state. Assume per-metre W=4000kN, U=1000kN, μ=0.6 and H=1500kN. R=1800kN and R/H=1.20, not a code safety factor. With phase differences between horizontal and vertical dynamics, the minimum friction margin need not occur at the peak horizontal force. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Limits of sliding equilibrium” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「滑動平衡的界限」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Limits of sliding equilibrium”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-25-k1","title":"滑動平衡的界限","titleEn":"Limits of sliding equilibrium","text":"簡化摩擦抵抗以有效法向力為基礎，底面揚壓不能忽略。摩擦係數受材料和接觸狀態影響，動態荷載、搖擺與地基破壞則另有機制；一個比值不能涵蓋所有施工與使用狀態。","textEn":"A friction estimate depends on effective normal force, including uplift reduction. Interface material and condition govern the coefficient, while dynamic loading, rocking and foundation failure involve additional mechanisms.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「滑動平衡的界限」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Limits of sliding equilibrium\" is correct?","options":["沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。","簡化摩擦抵抗以有效法向力為基礎，底面揚壓不能忽略。","偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。"],"optionsEn":["A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance.","A friction estimate depends on effective normal force, including uplift reduction.","Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact."],"answer":1,"explanation":"簡化摩擦抵抗以有效法向力為基礎，底面揚壓不能忽略。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A friction estimate depends on effective normal force, including uplift reduction. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b283-v15-26","title":"滑動平衡的界限：定量估算","titleEn":"Limits of sliding equilibrium: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「滑動平衡的界限」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Limits of sliding equilibrium” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米W=4000kN、U=1000kN、μ=0.6、H=1500kN，R=μ(W−U)=1800kN，R/H=1.20；非規範安全係數。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume per-metre W=4000kN, U=1000kN, μ=0.6 and H=1500kN. R=1800kN and R/H=1.20, not a code safety factor. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對重量、揚壓和水平力是否來自同一受力情境，說明摩擦係數的試驗依據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check that weight, uplift and horizontal force belong to one loading case and document interface testing for friction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米W=4000kN、U=1000kN、μ=0.6、H=1500kN，R=μ(W−U)=1800kN，R/H=1.20；非規範安全係數。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume per-metre W=4000kN, U=1000kN, μ=0.6 and H=1500kN. R=1800kN and R/H=1.20, not a code safety factor.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「滑動平衡的界限」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Limits of sliding equilibrium\", which statement holds?","options":["已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。","平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow.","Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b283-v15-27","title":"滑動平衡的界限：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Limits of sliding equilibrium: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「滑動平衡的界限」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Limits of sliding equilibrium” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對重量、揚壓和水平力是否來自同一受力情境，說明摩擦係數的試驗依據。再分別列出地基、傾覆及接觸不完整的檢查，避免用一個比例替代多種失效。檢查同時刻的水平力與底面揚壓。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check that weight, uplift and horizontal force belong to one loading case and document interface testing for friction. Separately assess foundation behavior, overturning and incomplete contact instead of substituting one ratio for multiple mechanisms. Check horizontal load and uplift at matching times. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：核對重量、揚壓和水平力是否來自同一受力情境，說明摩擦係數的試驗依據。再分別列出地基、傾覆及接觸不完整的檢查，避免用一個比例替代多種失效。","observationEn":"Site practice: Check that weight, uplift and horizontal force belong to one loading case and document interface testing for friction. Separately assess foundation behavior, overturning and incomplete contact instead of substituting one ratio for multiple mechanisms.","failure":"注意干擾：揚壓上升會在外觀重量不變時降低接觸反力，底面細料流失也可能改變摩擦條件；若沿用初期乾接觸係數，計算上的餘裕會比實際系統更樂觀。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Rising uplift reduces contact while visible weight remains unchanged, and loss of fines changes the interface. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對重量、揚壓和水平力是否來自同一受力情境，說明摩擦係數的試驗依據。再分別列出地基、傾覆及接觸不完整的檢查，避免用一個比例替代多種失效。檢查同時刻的水平力與底面揚壓。","textEn":"Check that weight, uplift and horizontal force belong to one loading case and document interface testing for friction. Separately assess foundation behavior, overturning and incomplete contact instead of substituting one ratio for multiple mechanisms. Check horizontal load and uplift at matching times.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"核對重量、揚壓和水平力是否來自同一受力情境，說明摩擦係數的試驗依據。再分別列出地基、傾覆及接觸不完整的檢查，避免用一個比例替代多種失效。","textEn":"Check that weight, uplift and horizontal force belong to one loading case and document interface testing for friction. Separately assess foundation behavior, overturning and incomplete contact instead of substituting one ratio for multiple mechanisms.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「滑動平衡的界限」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Limits of sliding equilibrium\"?","options":["核對重量、揚壓和水平力是否來自同一受力情境，說明摩擦係數的試驗依據。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["Check that weight, uplift and horizontal force belong to one loading case and document interface testing for friction.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect."],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對重量、揚壓和水平力是否來自同一受力情境，說明摩擦係數的試驗依據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check that weight, uplift and horizontal force belong to one loading case and document interface testing for friction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b283-v15-28","title":"滑動平衡的界限：失效診斷","titleEn":"Limits of sliding equilibrium: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「滑動平衡的界限」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Limits of sliding equilibrium” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"揚壓上升會在外觀重量不變時降低接觸反力，底面細料流失也可能改變摩擦條件；若沿用初期乾接觸係數，計算上的餘裕會比實際系統更樂觀。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Rising uplift reduces contact while visible weight remains unchanged, and loss of fines changes the interface. Retaining an initial dry-contact coefficient can therefore overstate the margin of the actual submerged foundation system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：水平與垂直動載若不同相位，摩擦餘裕的最小時刻不一定是最大水平力時刻。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: With phase differences between horizontal and vertical dynamics, the minimum friction margin need not occur at the peak horizontal force.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"揚壓上升會在外觀重量不變時降低接觸反力，底面細料流失也可能改變摩擦條件；若沿用初期乾接觸係數，計算上的餘裕會比實際系統更樂觀。","textEn":"Rising uplift reduces contact while visible weight remains unchanged, and loss of fines changes the interface. Retaining an initial dry-contact coefficient can therefore overstate the margin of the actual submerged foundation system.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「滑動平衡的界限」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Limits of sliding equilibrium\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","揚壓上升會在外觀重量不變時降低接觸反力，底面細料流失也可能改變摩擦條件；若沿用初期乾接觸係數，計算上的餘裕會比實際系統更樂觀。","偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Rising uplift reduces contact while visible weight remains unchanged, and loss of fines changes the interface.","Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact."],"answer":1,"explanation":"揚壓上升會在外觀重量不變時降低接觸反力，底面細料流失也可能改變摩擦條件；若沿用初期乾接觸係數，計算上的餘裕會比實際系統更樂觀。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Rising uplift reduces contact while visible weight remains unchanged, and loss of fines changes the interface. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b283-v15-29","title":"偏心與全接觸：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Eccentricity and full contact: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「偏心與全接觸」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Eccentricity and full contact” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"垂直合力的偏心會改變底面壓力，矩形底面在線彈性全接觸假設下才有核心界線。邊緣計算壓力降為零表示接觸模型來到界限，超出後應改用不承拉接觸，而非讓地基承受虛構拉力。 假設每米N=2000kN、M=4000kN·m、B=12m，e=M/N=2m=B/6；qmax=333.3kPa、qmin=0，為全接觸邊界。 這個壓力圖只處理接觸分布，不包含基床材料強度或循環退化的判定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「偏心與全接觸」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Eccentric vertical force redistributes base pressure. The rectangular kern applies to a linear full-contact model; zero edge pressure marks its boundary. Beyond that point, use no-tension contact rather than allowing a foundation to resist fictitious tensile pressure. Assume per-metre N=2000kN, M=4000kN·m and B=12m. e=2m=B/6; qmax=333.3kPa and qmin=0 at the full-contact boundary. This pressure diagram addresses contact distribution only; it does not establish bedding-material strength or resistance to deterioration under cyclic loading. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Eccentricity and full contact” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「偏心與全接觸」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Eccentricity and full contact”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-29-k1","title":"偏心與全接觸","titleEn":"Eccentricity and full contact","text":"垂直合力的偏心會改變底面壓力，矩形底面在線彈性全接觸假設下才有核心界線。邊緣計算壓力降為零表示接觸模型來到界限，超出後應改用不承拉接觸，而非讓地基承受虛構拉力。","textEn":"Eccentric vertical force redistributes base pressure. The rectangular kern applies to a linear full-contact model; zero edge pressure marks its boundary.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「偏心與全接觸」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Eccentricity and full contact\" is correct?","options":["偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。","兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。","垂直合力的偏心會改變底面壓力，矩形底面在線彈性全接觸假設下才有核心界線。"],"optionsEn":["Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact.","Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation.","Eccentric vertical force redistributes base pressure."],"answer":2,"explanation":"垂直合力的偏心會改變底面壓力，矩形底面在線彈性全接觸假設下才有核心界線。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Eccentric vertical force redistributes base pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b283-v15-30","title":"偏心與全接觸：定量估算","titleEn":"Eccentricity and full contact: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「偏心與全接觸」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Eccentricity and full contact” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米N=2000kN、M=4000kN·m、B=12m，e=M/N=2m=B/6；qmax=333.3kPa、qmin=0，為全接觸邊界。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume per-metre N=2000kN, M=4000kN·m and B=12m. e=2m=B/6; qmax=333.3kPa and qmin=0 at the full-contact boundary. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：明示力矩參考點和正負方向，獨立積分壓力分布重建原法向力與力矩。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: State the moment reference and signs, independently integrating pressure to recover force and moment.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米N=2000kN、M=4000kN·m、B=12m，e=M/N=2m=B/6；qmax=333.3kPa、qmin=0，為全接觸邊界。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume per-metre N=2000kN, M=4000kN·m and B=12m. e=2m=B/6; qmax=333.3kPa and qmin=0 at the full-contact boundary.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「偏心與全接觸」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Eccentricity and full contact\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。","初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass.","Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b283-v15-31","title":"偏心與全接觸：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Eccentricity and full contact: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「偏心與全接觸」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Eccentricity and full contact” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"明示力矩參考點和正負方向，獨立積分壓力分布重建原法向力與力矩。檢查底床平整度、接觸缺口及土體承載，不能把幾何核心條件當成完整承載驗算。以壓力圖積分核對合力作用位置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"State the moment reference and signs, independently integrating pressure to recover force and moment. Check bedding flatness, gaps and ground resistance; the geometric kern condition is not a complete bearing-capacity assessment. Integrate the pressure diagram to verify the resultant location. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：明示力矩參考點和正負方向，獨立積分壓力分布重建原法向力與力矩。檢查底床平整度、接觸缺口及土體承載，不能把幾何核心條件當成完整承載驗算。","observationEn":"Site practice: State the moment reference and signs, independently integrating pressure to recover force and moment. Check bedding flatness, gaps and ground resistance; the geometric kern condition is not a complete bearing-capacity assessment.","failure":"注意干擾：直接接受負接觸壓力會高估有效承壓面積，局部接觸其實可能集中在狹窄邊緣；平均壓力仍小時，局部地基破壞和沉箱轉動已可能開始。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Accepting negative contact pressure overstates effective bearing area when actual contact is concentrated near an edge. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"明示力矩參考點和正負方向，獨立積分壓力分布重建原法向力與力矩。檢查底床平整度、接觸缺口及土體承載，不能把幾何核心條件當成完整承載驗算。以壓力圖積分核對合力作用位置。","textEn":"State the moment reference and signs, independently integrating pressure to recover force and moment. Check bedding flatness, gaps and ground resistance; the geometric kern condition is not a complete bearing-capacity assessment. Integrate the pressure diagram to verify the resultant location.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"明示力矩參考點和正負方向，獨立積分壓力分布重建原法向力與力矩。檢查底床平整度、接觸缺口及土體承載，不能把幾何核心條件當成完整承載驗算。","textEn":"State the moment reference and signs, independently integrating pressure to recover force and moment. Check bedding flatness, gaps and ground resistance; the geometric kern condition is not a complete bearing-capacity assessment.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「偏心與全接觸」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Eccentricity and full contact\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","明示力矩參考點和正負方向，獨立積分壓力分布重建原法向力與力矩。","計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","State the moment reference and signs, independently integrating pressure to recover force and moment.","A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"明示力矩參考點和正負方向，獨立積分壓力分布重建原法向力與力矩。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"State the moment reference and signs, independently integrating pressure to recover force and moment. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b283-v15-32","title":"偏心與全接觸：失效診斷","titleEn":"Eccentricity and full contact: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「偏心與全接觸」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Eccentricity and full contact” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"直接接受負接觸壓力會高估有效承壓面積，局部接觸其實可能集中在狹窄邊緣；平均壓力仍小時，局部地基破壞和沉箱轉動已可能開始。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Accepting negative contact pressure overstates effective bearing area when actual contact is concentrated near an edge. Local foundation failure and caisson rotation can begin even while the computed average pressure remains modest. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這個壓力圖只處理接觸分布，不包含基床材料強度或循環退化的判定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: This pressure diagram addresses contact distribution only; it does not establish bedding-material strength or resistance to deterioration under cyclic loading.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「偏心超出核心後仍可讓地基以負壓力維持全接觸。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Beyond the kern, negative foundation pressure can preserve full contact.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"直接接受負接觸壓力會高估有效承壓面積，局部接觸其實可能集中在狹窄邊緣；平均壓力仍小時，局部地基破壞和沉箱轉動已可能開始。","textEn":"Accepting negative contact pressure overstates effective bearing area when actual contact is concentrated near an edge. Local foundation failure and caisson rotation can begin even while the computed average pressure remains modest.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「偏心與全接觸」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Eccentricity and full contact\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。","直接接受負接觸壓力會高估有效承壓面積，局部接觸其實可能集中在狹窄邊緣；平均壓力仍小時，局部地基破壞和沉箱轉動已可能開始。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation.","Accepting negative contact pressure overstates effective bearing area when actual contact is concentrated near an edge."],"answer":2,"explanation":"直接接受負接觸壓力會高估有效承壓面積，局部接觸其實可能集中在狹窄邊緣；平均壓力仍小時，局部地基破壞和沉箱轉動已可能開始。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Accepting negative contact pressure overstates effective bearing area when actual contact is concentrated near an edge. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b283-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「差異沉陷與轉角」與「雙側水壓與越流」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Differential settlement and rotation\" and \"Two-sided pressure and overflow\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b283-v15-33","title":"差異沉陷與轉角：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Differential settlement and rotation: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「差異沉陷與轉角」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Differential settlement and rotation” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"相鄰或同一沉箱兩端的差異沉陷會改變接縫、堤頂和上部設施幾何，並不等同平均下沉。小轉角可由兩點高差估算，但沉箱彎曲或局部支承變形會破壞剛體近似，需要多點資料辨識。 假設兩端相距20m、沉陷差20mm，θ≈0.020/20=0.001rad=0.0573°；只作剛體小角示意。 多點資料還能辨識局部支承沉陷，兩端連線以外的殘差不應直接當量測噪音。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「差異沉陷與轉角」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Differential movement changes joints, crest and upper facilities and is distinct from mean settlement. Two-point elevation difference estimates a small rigid-body rotation, but flexure or localized support deformation violates that approximation and requires additional observations to distinguish. Assume endpoints20m apart with20mm differential settlement. θ≈0.020/20=0.001rad=0.0573° is a small rigid-body illustration. Additional points can reveal localized support movement; residuals away from the endpoint line should not automatically be dismissed as measurement noise. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Differential settlement and rotation” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「差異沉陷與轉角」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Differential settlement and rotation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-33-k1","title":"差異沉陷與轉角","titleEn":"Differential settlement and rotation","text":"相鄰或同一沉箱兩端的差異沉陷會改變接縫、堤頂和上部設施幾何，並不等同平均下沉。小轉角可由兩點高差估算，但沉箱彎曲或局部支承變形會破壞剛體近似，需要多點資料辨識。","textEn":"Differential movement changes joints, crest and upper facilities and is distinct from mean settlement. Two-point elevation difference estimates a small rigid-body rotation, but flexure or localized support deformation violates that approximation and requires additional observations to distinguish.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「差異沉陷與轉角」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Differential settlement and rotation\" is correct?","options":["相鄰或同一沉箱兩端的差異沉陷會改變接縫、堤頂和上部設施幾何，並不等同平均下沉。","兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。","已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。"],"optionsEn":["Differential movement changes joints, crest and upper facilities and is distinct from mean settlement.","Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation.","Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相鄰或同一沉箱兩端的差異沉陷會改變接縫、堤頂和上部設施幾何，並不等同平均下沉。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Differential movement changes joints, crest and upper facilities and is distinct from mean settlement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b283-v15-34","title":"差異沉陷與轉角：定量估算","titleEn":"Differential settlement and rotation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「差異沉陷與轉角」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Differential settlement and rotation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設兩端相距20m、沉陷差20mm，θ≈0.020/20=0.001rad=0.0573°；只作剛體小角示意。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume endpoints20m apart with20mm differential settlement. θ≈0.020/20=0.001rad=0.0573° is a small rigid-body illustration. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以共同穩定基準同步測量多個角點，分解平均沉陷、剛體轉動與局部殘差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Observe several corners against one stable datum, separating mean settlement, rigid rotation and local residuals.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設兩端相距20m、沉陷差20mm，θ≈0.020/20=0.001rad=0.0573°；只作剛體小角示意。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume endpoints20m apart with20mm differential settlement. θ≈0.020/20=0.001rad=0.0573° is a small rigid-body illustration.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「差異沉陷與轉角」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Differential settlement and rotation\", which statement holds?","options":["平均吃水吻合就可忽略四角差異與艙口進水可能。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","艙水總量不變時自由液面對浮穩的影響也不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["Matching mean draft makes corner differences and flooding through openings irrelevant.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","An unchanged quantity of tank water means an unchanged free-surface effect."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b283-v15-35","title":"差異沉陷與轉角：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Differential settlement and rotation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「差異沉陷與轉角」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Differential settlement and rotation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以共同穩定基準同步測量多個角點，分解平均沉陷、剛體轉動與局部殘差。把接縫張開與基床量測相互對照，保留無法由剛體模型解釋的變形供調查。檢查中間測點相對剛體線的殘差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Observe several corners against one stable datum, separating mean settlement, rigid rotation and local residuals. Compare joint opening with foundation measurements and preserve deformation that the rigid-body model cannot explain for investigation. Check intermediate observations against the rigid-body line residuals. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以共同穩定基準同步測量多個角點，分解平均沉陷、剛體轉動與局部殘差。把接縫張開與基床量測相互對照，保留無法由剛體模型解釋的變形供調查。","observationEn":"Site practice: Observe several corners against one stable datum, separating mean settlement, rigid rotation and local residuals. Compare joint opening with foundation measurements and preserve deformation that the rigid-body model cannot explain for investigation.","failure":"注意干擾：基準點本身移動會讓整體沉陷被抵銷，僅看兩點又可能把彎曲誤認為旋轉。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Movement of the reference hides overall settlement, while two points can confuse flexure with rotation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以共同穩定基準同步測量多個角點，分解平均沉陷、剛體轉動與局部殘差。把接縫張開與基床量測相互對照，保留無法由剛體模型解釋的變形供調查。檢查中間測點相對剛體線的殘差。","textEn":"Observe several corners against one stable datum, separating mean settlement, rigid rotation and local residuals. Compare joint opening with foundation measurements and preserve deformation that the rigid-body model cannot explain for investigation. Check intermediate observations against the rigid-body line residuals.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以共同穩定基準同步測量多個角點，分解平均沉陷、剛體轉動與局部殘差。把接縫張開與基床量測相互對照，保留無法由剛體模型解釋的變形供調查。","textEn":"Observe several corners against one stable datum, separating mean settlement, rigid rotation and local residuals. Compare joint opening with foundation measurements and preserve deformation that the rigid-body model cannot explain for investigation.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「差異沉陷與轉角」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Differential settlement and rotation\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","底面揚壓永遠是海側與港側水壓的線性連線。","以共同穩定基準同步測量多個角點，分解平均沉陷、剛體轉動與局部殘差。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Base uplift always follows a straight line between sea-side and harbor-side pressure.","Observe several corners against one stable datum, separating mean settlement, rigid rotation and local residuals."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以共同穩定基準同步測量多個角點，分解平均沉陷、剛體轉動與局部殘差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Observe several corners against one stable datum, separating mean settlement, rigid rotation and local residuals. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b283-v15-36","title":"差異沉陷與轉角：失效診斷","titleEn":"Differential settlement and rotation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「差異沉陷與轉角」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Differential settlement and rotation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"基準點本身移動會讓整體沉陷被抵銷，僅看兩點又可能把彎曲誤認為旋轉。若忽略局部接觸變化，後續止水損壞與上部設備偏移便難以追溯原因。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Movement of the reference hides overall settlement, while two points can confuse flexure with rotation. Ignoring local contact changes then obscures the causes of later joint leakage or misalignment in the facilities above. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：多點資料還能辨識局部支承沉陷，兩端連線以外的殘差不應直接當量測噪音。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Additional points can reveal localized support movement; residuals away from the endpoint line should not automatically be dismissed as measurement noise.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「兩點高差計算出的轉角可以完整代表沉箱所有變形。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Rotation calculated from two elevations fully describes every caisson deformation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"基準點本身移動會讓整體沉陷被抵銷，僅看兩點又可能把彎曲誤認為旋轉。若忽略局部接觸變化，後續止水損壞與上部設備偏移便難以追溯原因。","textEn":"Movement of the reference hides overall settlement, while two points can confuse flexure with rotation. Ignoring local contact changes then obscures the causes of later joint leakage or misalignment in the facilities above.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「差異沉陷與轉角」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Differential settlement and rotation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["基準點本身移動會讓整體沉陷被抵銷，僅看兩點又可能把彎曲誤認為旋轉。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。"],"optionsEn":["Movement of the reference hides overall settlement, while two points can confuse flexure with rotation.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow."],"answer":0,"explanation":"基準點本身移動會讓整體沉陷被抵銷，僅看兩點又可能把彎曲誤認為旋轉。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Movement of the reference hides overall settlement, while two points can confuse flexure with rotation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b283-v15-37","title":"雙側水壓與越流：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Two-sided pressure and overflow: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「雙側水壓與越流」如何影響沉箱式防波堤施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Two-sided pressure and overflow” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Caisson breakwater construction”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"靜水壓在兩側分別積分後才可相減，單一水位差乘整面積通常會漏掉壓力分布。越流海嘯可能伴隨背面負壓和基床沖刷，已超出靜水模型；不能將正常潮位算式當成極端事件荷載。 假設同底面起算兩側靜水深8與6m、海水γ=10.05525kN/m³，每米淨力F=γ(8²−6²)/2=140.7735kN；非海嘯力。 靜水三角形的作用點位於各水深底部以上三分之一，兩側力矩仍須分開計算。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「雙側水壓與越流」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Hydrostatic pressure is integrated separately on each side before subtraction; one head difference times the entire wall area generally misses the distribution. Tsunami overflow can include rear suction and foundation scour beyond hydrostatics, so ordinary tide calculations cannot establish extreme-event loading. Assume still depths8m and6m from one base and seawater γ=10.05525kN/m³. Net force per metre isγ(8²−6²)/2=140.7735kN, not tsunami force. Each hydrostatic triangle acts one-third of its depth above the base, requiring separate moment calculation before subtracting the two sides. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Two-sided pressure and overflow” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「雙側水壓與越流」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Two-sided pressure and overflow”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-37-k1","title":"雙側水壓與越流","titleEn":"Two-sided pressure and overflow","text":"靜水壓在兩側分別積分後才可相減，單一水位差乘整面積通常會漏掉壓力分布。越流海嘯可能伴隨背面負壓和基床沖刷，已超出靜水模型；不能將正常潮位算式當成極端事件荷載。","textEn":"Hydrostatic pressure is integrated separately on each side before subtraction; one head difference times the entire wall area generally misses the distribution. Tsunami overflow can include rear suction and foundation scour beyond hydrostatics, so ordinary tide calculations cannot establish extreme-event loading.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「雙側水壓與越流」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Two-sided pressure and overflow\" is correct?","options":["已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。","靜水壓在兩側分別積分後才可相減，單一水位差乘整面積通常會漏掉壓力分布。","沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。"],"optionsEn":["Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow.","Hydrostatic pressure is integrated separately on each side before subtraction; one head difference times the entire wall area generally misses the distribution.","Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass."],"answer":1,"explanation":"靜水壓在兩側分別積分後才可相減，單一水位差乘整面積通常會漏掉壓力分布。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Hydrostatic pressure is integrated separately on each side before subtraction; one head difference times the entire wall area generally misses the distribution. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b283-v15-38","title":"雙側水壓與越流：定量估算","titleEn":"Two-sided pressure and overflow: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「雙側水壓與越流」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Two-sided pressure and overflow” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設同底面起算兩側靜水深8與6m、海水γ=10.05525kN/m³，每米淨力F=γ(8²−6²)/2=140.7735kN；非海嘯力。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume still depths8m and6m from one base and seawater γ=10.05525kN/m³. Net force per metre isγ(8²−6²)/2=140.7735kN, not tsunami force. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：畫出兩側三角壓力圖和各自作用點，再核對有無越流、流速及底床演變。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw both triangular pressure distributions and their application points, then check overflow, velocity and bed evolution.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設同底面起算兩側靜水深8與6m、海水γ=10.05525kN/m³，每米淨力F=γ(8²−6²)/2=140.7735kN；非海嘯力。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume still depths8m and6m from one base and seawater γ=10.05525kN/m³. Net force per metre isγ(8²−6²)/2=140.7735kN, not tsunami force.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「雙側水壓與越流」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Two-sided pressure and overflow\", which statement holds?","options":["初穩心高度大於零就代表任何傾角與拖航海況都安全。","計算出平均吃水增量後就能直接指定現場配重操作順序。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Positive metacentric height guarantees safety at every heel angle and towing condition.","A calculated mean draft increment directly determines the field ballasting sequence.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b283-v15-39","title":"雙側水壓與越流：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Two-sided pressure and overflow: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「雙側水壓與越流」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Two-sided pressure and overflow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"畫出兩側三角壓力圖和各自作用點，再核對有無越流、流速及底床演變。與水工試驗和事件記錄比對，明列哪些附加作用沒有包含在靜水差值中。分別計算兩側水壓對底部的力矩。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw both triangular pressure distributions and their application points, then check overflow, velocity and bed evolution. Compare hydraulic tests or event records and explicitly list additional actions omitted from the static pressure difference. Calculate each side's pressure moment about the base separately. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫出兩側三角壓力圖和各自作用點，再核對有無越流、流速及底床演變。與水工試驗和事件記錄比對，明列哪些附加作用沒有包含在靜水差值中。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw both triangular pressure distributions and their application points, then check overflow, velocity and bed evolution. Compare hydraulic tests or event records and explicitly list additional actions omitted from the static pressure difference.","failure":"注意干擾：越流背面吸力會在水位差相同時增加水平作用，沖刷又會削弱支承；只放大靜水力而不更新接觸與底床，可能錯過真正導致沉箱移動的組合機制。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Rear suction increases horizontal action at unchanged head difference, while scour weakens support. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"畫出兩側三角壓力圖和各自作用點，再核對有無越流、流速及底床演變。與水工試驗和事件記錄比對，明列哪些附加作用沒有包含在靜水差值中。分別計算兩側水壓對底部的力矩。","textEn":"Draw both triangular pressure distributions and their application points, then check overflow, velocity and bed evolution. Compare hydraulic tests or event records and explicitly list additional actions omitted from the static pressure difference. Calculate each side's pressure moment about the base separately.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫出兩側三角壓力圖和各自作用點，再核對有無越流、流速及底床演變。與水工試驗和事件記錄比對，明列哪些附加作用沒有包含在靜水差值中。","textEn":"Draw both triangular pressure distributions and their application points, then check overflow, velocity and bed evolution. Compare hydraulic tests or event records and explicitly list additional actions omitted from the static pressure difference.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「雙側水壓與越流」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Two-sided pressure and overflow\"?","options":["畫出兩側三角壓力圖和各自作用點，再核對有無越流、流速及底床演變。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","沉箱自重很大就可以忽略揚壓對滑動抵抗的影響。"],"optionsEn":["Draw both triangular pressure distributions and their application points, then check overflow, velocity and bed evolution.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A very heavy caisson makes uplift irrelevant to sliding resistance."],"answer":0,"explanation":"畫出兩側三角壓力圖和各自作用點，再核對有無越流、流速及底床演變。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw both triangular pressure distributions and their application points, then check overflow, velocity and bed evolution. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b283-v15-40","title":"雙側水壓與越流：失效診斷","titleEn":"Two-sided pressure and overflow: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"prerequisiteIds":["b283-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「雙側水壓與越流」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Two-sided pressure and overflow” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"越流背面吸力會在水位差相同時增加水平作用，沖刷又會削弱支承；只放大靜水力而不更新接觸與底床，可能錯過真正導致沉箱移動的組合機制。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Rear suction increases horizontal action at unchanged head difference, while scour weakens support. Multiplying static force without updating contact and bedding can miss the coupled mechanism that actually initiates caisson displacement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：靜水三角形的作用點位於各水深底部以上三分之一，兩側力矩仍須分開計算。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Each hydrostatic triangle acts one-third of its depth above the base, requiring separate moment calculation before subtracting the two sides.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「已知兩側水位差就足以算出任何海嘯越流時的總荷載。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Knowing the two water levels is sufficient for total loading under any tsunami overflow.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b283-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"越流背面吸力會在水位差相同時增加水平作用，沖刷又會削弱支承；只放大靜水力而不更新接觸與底床，可能錯過真正導致沉箱移動的組合機制。","textEn":"Rear suction increases horizontal action at unchanged head difference, while scour weakens support. Multiplying static force without updating contact and bedding can miss the coupled mechanism that actually initiates caisson displacement.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]},{"id":"b283-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「雙側水壓與越流」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Two-sided pressure and overflow\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","越流背面吸力會在水位差相同時增加水平作用，沖刷又會削弱支承；只放大靜水力而不更新接觸與底床，可能錯過真正導致沉箱移動的組合機制。","沉箱外包體積乘混凝土密度就等於實際總重量。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Rear suction increases horizontal action at unchanged head difference, while scour weakens support.","Caisson envelope volume times concrete density equals its actual total mass."],"answer":1,"explanation":"越流背面吸力會在水位差相同時增加水平作用，沖刷又會削弱支承；只放大靜水力而不更新接觸與底床，可能錯過真正導致沉箱移動的組合機制。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Rear suction increases horizontal action at unchanged head difference, while scour weakens support. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-kamaishi","v15s-cem","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-final"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
